{"durationMs":58804,"paragraphs":[{"text":"Oggi parliamo del ciclo dell'acqua. L'acqua dei mari e dei laghi si scalda al sole e diventa vapore, che sale verso l'alto senza che lo vediamo.","startMs":737,"endMs":10688,"words":[[0,4,737,1212],[5,13,1212,1922],[14,17,1922,2163],[18,23,2163,2666],[24,34,2666,4726],[36,43,4726,5312],[44,47,5312,5560],[48,52,5560,6090],[53,54,6090,6207],[55,58,6207,6448],[59,64,6448,6937],[65,67,6937,7151],[68,74,7151,7688],[75,77,7688,7860],[78,82,7860,8425],[83,84,8425,8549],[85,92,8549,9149],[93,99,9149,10230],[101,104,10230,10410],[105,109,10410,10871],[110,115,10871,11353],[116,122,11353,11870],[123,128,11870,12380],[129,132,12380,12566],[133,135,12566,12711],[136,143,12711,10688]]},{"text":"Salendo, il vapore incontra aria più fredda e si condensa in goccioline minuscole. Sono loro a formare le nuvole, che il vento porta lontano anche per centinaia di chilometri.","startMs":13425,"endMs":25575,"words":[[0,7,13425,14700],[9,11,14700,14920],[12,18,14920,15520],[19,27,15520,16236],[28,32,16236,16691],[33,36,16691,16939],[37,43,16939,17628],[44,45,17628,17731],[46,48,17731,17958],[49,57,17958,18702],[58,60,18702,18902],[61,71,18902,19653],[72,81,19653,21733],[83,87,21733,22140],[88,92,22140,22560],[93,94,22560,22657],[95,102,22657,23270],[103,105,23270,23421],[106,112,23421,24455],[114,117,24455,24661],[118,120,24661,24833],[121,126,24833,25350],[127,132,25350,25929],[133,140,25929,26590],[141,146,26590,27024],[147,150,27024,27258],[151,160,27258,28112],[161,163,28112,28264],[164,174,28264,25575]]},{"text":"Quando le goccioline diventano troppo pesanti, cadono come pioggia, oppure come neve se fa molto freddo. Una parte dell'acqua scorre nei fiumi, un'altra entra nel terreno e riempie le falde.","startMs":28312,"endMs":41717,"words":[[0,6,28312,28877],[7,9,28877,29028],[10,20,29028,29827],[21,30,29827,30620],[31,37,30620,31150],[38,45,31150,32411],[47,53,32411,33010],[54,58,33010,33396],[59,66,33396,34485],[68,74,34485,35077],[75,79,35077,35463],[80,84,35463,35821],[85,87,35821,36083],[88,90,36083,36317],[91,96,36317,36793],[97,103,36793,38729],[105,108,38729,39025],[109,114,39025,39576],[115,125,39576,40320],[126,132,40320,40858],[133,136,40858,41099],[137,142,41099,42139],[144,152,42139,42828],[153,158,42828,43255],[159,162,43255,43489],[163,170,43489,44227],[171,172,44227,44357],[173,180,44357,44957],[181,183,44957,45108],[184,189,45108,41717]]},{"text":"Alla fine l'acqua torna al mare, e il ciclo ricomincia. È lo stesso viaggio da miliardi di anni: l'acqua che beviamo oggi potrebbe essere passata da un ghiacciaio, o da una nuvola sopra un altro continente.","startMs":44454,"endMs":58304,"words":[[0,4,44454,44771],[5,9,44771,45219],[10,17,45219,45791],[18,23,45791,46238],[24,26,46238,46362],[27,31,46362,47279],[33,34,47279,47430],[35,37,47430,47630],[38,43,47630,48161],[44,54,48161,50317],[56,57,50317,50462],[58,60,50462,50613],[61,67,50613,51206],[68,75,51206,51750],[76,78,51750,51922],[79,87,51922,52645],[88,90,52645,52811],[91,95,52811,53741],[97,104,53741,54361],[105,108,54361,54533],[109,116,54533,55181],[117,121,55181,55615],[122,130,55615,56324],[131,137,56324,56848],[138,145,56848,57530],[146,148,57530,57695],[149,151,57695,57895],[152,162,57895,59170],[164,165,59170,59397],[166,168,59397,59569],[169,172,59569,59845],[173,179,59845,60362],[180,185,60362,60865],[186,188,60865,61044],[189,194,61044,61491],[195,205,61491,58304]]}]}